"20.767" end="21.651">lo</span><span begin="21.651" end="21.880">st</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">终于明白 宝藏总会迷失</span></p><p begin="24.192" end="30.143" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="24.192" end="24.692">Plea</span><span begin="24.692" end="26.187">sures</span> <span begin="26.187" end="26.611">and</span> <span begin="26.611" end="27.890">ra</span><span begin="27.890" end="28.081">ge</span> <span begin="28.081" end="28.593">com</span><span begin="28.593" end="30.143">bined</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">快乐与愤怒如影随形</span></p><p begin="31.884" end="34.904" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.884" end="32.485">I&apos;m</span> <span begin="32.485" end="33.309">wa</span><span begin="33.309" end="33.644">tch</span><span begin="33.644" end="34.379">in&apos;</span> <span begin="34.379" end="34.904">you</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我紧盯着你</span></p><p begin="38.542" end="41.634" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.542" end="38.687">Be</span> <span begin="38.687" end="39.453">care</span><span begin="39.453" end="39.745">ful</span> <span begin="39.745" end="40.410">with</span> <span begin="40.410" end="40.738">your</span> <span begin="40.738" end="41.634">moves</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">小心你的一举一动</span></p><p begin="43.557" end="53.025" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="43.557" end="44.031">To</span><span begin="44.031" end="45.226">night,</span> <span begin="47.412" end="47.784">I</span> <span begin="47.784" end="49.366">think</span> <span begin="49.366" end="49.754">the</span> <span begin="49.754" end="51.278">time</span> <span begin="51.278" end="51.723">is</span> <span begin="51.723" end="53.025">right</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我想 今夜就是绝佳时机</span></p><p begin="55.190" end="1:01.505" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="55.190" end="55.512">I</span> <span begin="55.512" end="57.128">think</span> <span begin="57.128" end="57.539">the</span> <span begin="57.539" end="59.107">blood</span> <span begin="59.107" end="59.495">has</span> <span begin="59.495" end="1:01.505">dried</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">血液已然干涸</span></p><p begin="1:02.937" end="1:06.241" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.937" end="1:03.331">It</span> <span begin="1:03.331" end="1:04.423">cries</span> <span begin="1:04.423" end="1:05.295">for</span> <span begin="1:05.295" end="1:06.241">more</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">心中渴求更多</span></p><p begin="1:09.480" end="1:13.162" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:09.480" end="1:09.707">So</span> <span begin="1:09.707" end="1:10.093">what</span> <span begin="1:10.093" end="1:10.467">are</span> <span begin="1:10.467" end="1:10.670">we</span> <span begin="1:10.670" end="1:11.212">wait</span><span begin="1:11.212" end="1:11.544">ing</span> <span begin="1:11.544" end="1:13.162">for?</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">所以我们还在等待什么</span></p><p begin="1:15.563" end="1:22.962" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:15.563" end="1:16.513">Wires</span> <span begin="1:16.513" end="1:16.866">and</span> <span begin="1:16.866" end="1:22.779">chain</span><span begin="1:22.779" end="1:22.962">s</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">束缚与锁链</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:17.489" end="1:22.252"><span begin="1:17.489" end="1:17.892">(I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:17.892" end="1:18.406">just</span> <span begin="1:18.406" end="1:18.954">tired</span> <span begin="1:18.954" end="1:19.400">of</span> <span begin="1:19.400" end="1:19.703">look</span><span begin="1:19.703" end="1:19.901">in&apos;</span> <span begin="1:19.901" end="1:20.176">the</span> <span begin="1:20.176" end="1:20.748">o</span><span begin="1:20.748" end="1:21.149">ther</span> <span begin="1:21.149" end="1:22.252">way)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已厌倦了睁一只眼闭一只眼</span></span></p><p begin="1:23.163" end="1:30.407" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:23.163" end="1:23.769">Start</span><span begin="1:23.769" end="1:24.131">ing</span> <span begin="1:24.131" end="1:24.593">to</span> <span begin="1:24.593" end="1:30.407">fade</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">慢慢消失不见</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:25.222" end="1:30.080"><span begin="1:25.222" end="1:25.638">(I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:25.638" end="1:26.147">just</span> <span begin="1:26.147" end="1:26.734">tired</span> <span begin="1:26.734" end="1:27.159">of</span> <span begin="1:27.159" end="1:27.423">look</span><span begin="1:27.423" end="1:27.633">in&apos;</span> <span begin="1:27.633" end="1:28.020">the</span> <span begin="1:28.020" end="1:28.553">o</span><span begin="1:28.553" end="1:28.912">ther</span> <span begin="1:28.912" end="1:30.080">way)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已厌倦了睁一只眼闭一只眼</span></span></p><p begin="1:30.839" end="1:38.354" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.839" end="1:30.990">It</span> <span begin="1:30.990" end="1:31.450">feels</span> <span begin="1:31.450" end="1:31.894">like</span> <span begin="1:31.894" end="1:32.425">a</span> <span begin="1:32.425" end="1:38.354">game</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">仿佛这是游戏一场</span><span ttm:role="x-bg" begin="1:33.012" end="1:37.806"><span begin="1:33.012" end="1:33.406">(I&apos;m</span> <span begin="1:33.406" end="1:33.903">just</span> <span begin="1:33.903" end="1:34.456">tired</span> <span begin="1:34.456" end="1:34.932">of</span> <span begin="1:34.932" end="1:35.170">look</span><span begin="1:35.170" end="1:35.382">in&apos;</span> <span begin="1:35.382" end="1:35.701">the</span> <span begin="1:35.701" end="1:36.289">o</span><span begin="1:36.289" end="1:36.604">ther</span> <span begin="1:36.604" end="1:37.806">way)</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">我已厌倦了睁一只眼闭一只眼</span></span></p><