n ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">无法直视你的双眼</span></p><p begin="2:12.612" end="2:16.768" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:12.612" end="2:13.003">Your</span> <span begin="2:13.003" end="2:14.080">twist</span><span begin="2:14.080" end="2:14.859">ed</span> <span begin="2:14.859" end="2:16.768">mind</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">你扭曲的心灵</span></p><p begin="2:18.707" end="2:22.188" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.707" end="2:19.381">It&apos;s</span> <span begin="2:19.381" end="2:20.331">dark,</span> <span begin="2:20.562" end="2:21.315">so</span> <span begin="2:21.315" end="2:22.188">dark</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">比夜晚更加黑暗</span></p><p begin="2:23.101" end="2:26.329" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:23.101" end="2:23.302">We</span> <span begin="2:23.302" end="2:24.239">end</span> <span begin="2:24.239" end="2:24.758">it</span> <span begin="2:24.758" end="2:26.329">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">让我们就此了结</span></p><p begin="2:28.099" end="2:33.891" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:28.099" end="2:28.566">It</span> <span begin="2:28.566" end="2:30.031">ends</span> <span begin="2:30.031" end="2:30.508">right</span> <span begin="2:30.508" end="2:31.957">here,</span> <span begin="2:31.957" end="2:32.477">right</span> <span begin="2:32.477" end="2:33.891">now</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">了结于此时此地</span></p><p begin="2:35.845" end="2:42.119" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:35.845" end="2:36.333">Please</span> <span begin="2:36.333" end="2:37.281">tell</span> <span begin="2:37.281" end="2:37.743">me</span> <span begin="2:37.743" end="2:38.245">you</span> <span begin="2:38.245" end="2:39.728">brought</span> <span begin="2:39.728" end="2:40.206">the</span> <span begin="2:40.206" end="2:42.119">iron</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-Hans">请告诉我你带了武器</span></p><p begin="2:43.32